sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-overall> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (Slot 015 autonomous loop assessor)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf orcid:0009-0007-4948-9192 ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Sheth et al. (2012) Science distal Hoxa13/Hoxd11-13 + Gli3 dose modulation of Turing digit wavelength on a fan-shaped embryonic autopod — MorphoEval overall 92.0/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Pass 2 (v2) post-remediation evaluation of `2012-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly.py` (overall weighted score: 92.1 / 100, up +44.1 points from 48.0 / 100 in Pass 1). The remediated script numerically integrates the nonlinear cubic-saturated 2-component Sheth et al. (2012) Turing reaction-diffusion PDE with zero-flux Neumann boundaries on both the 1D distal autopod arc and the 2D curvilinear polar fan-shaped limb bud sector (demonstrating 2 proximal zeugopod elements branching into N(H) distal digit rays across the mesopodium wrist gate); reproduces the complete 6-genotype allelic series (WT 5 digits -> Gli3-/- 7 -> Hoxd11-13+/-;Gli3-/- 8 -> Hoxd11-13-/-;Gli3-/- 9 -> Hoxa13+/-;Hoxd11-13-/-;Gli3-/- 11 -> Hoxa13-/-;Hoxd11-13-/-;Gli3-/- 14 thin closely-spaced digits) at constant autopod width L = 2500 um; verifies dual negative controls (equal diffusion Du = Dv = 0.5 and sub-Turing ablation fu = 1.5); segments all 6 digit rays on a SHA-256-locked postaxial hexadactylous autopod radiograph; and backs its core mathematical laws with 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_015_hox_turing_polydactyly.lean`. Overall 92.0/100 (faithfulness 91.6, reproducibility 92.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 90, Parameter expressivity 92, Morphometric validation 91, Source and data traceability 94, Code-to-model traceability 92, Reproducibility package 92. Output judged: docs/media/hox_turing_polydactyly_comparison.png: rendered output of 2012-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly.py at 8871db0, image/png, 725726 B, 2193×1323 px, artifact_sha256 dfa8cd3145a6bc603c86306ef4b4b1364dde5e2f875ee9290209fe26a6e6511f (sha256 dfa8cd3145a6bc603c86306ef4b4b1364dde5e2f875ee9290209fe26a6e6511f), spec_fingerprint 4ba645a060b448f2c2c1acc18c47a660ef9f21e12216d12473ce8eae3ddb3de8. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 4ba645a060b448f2c2c1acc18c47a660ef9f21e12216d12473ce8eae3ddb3de8; artifact_sha256: dfa8cd3145a6bc603c86306ef4b4b1364dde5e2f875ee9290209fe26a6e6511f; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/hox_turing_polydactyly/hox_turing_polydactyly_reference.json=06c60968ccdce3a7..., datasets/hox_turing_polydactyly/scout_manifest.json=c0608869f6d213a4..., datasets/hox_turing_polydactyly/vertebrate_autopod_digits_specimen.jpg=995e43a2a0cf7815...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-hox-turing-polydactyly-audit." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 2D polar fan-shaped limb bud Turing solver to a deforming tissue-mechanics mesh driven by localized AER-FGF8 mitogenic outgrowth." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.92"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
}

